; Windfall's orchard: one node in the arena that carries every tree the spell plants, every fruit they drop, the thorns,
; the rot and the lashing branches, in fixed pools (scripts/Windfall.cs). It draws the air itself (DrawLayers.Air), a child
; the floor (Ground), and the trees stand one node each in a y-sorted holder it adds to the arena, on the bodies' layer, so
; each sorts at its foot. No collision shape anywhere: a tree blocks nothing, and a fruit strikes what is near where it
; lands. The art is tools/art/windfall.py's sheet.
